{"EventType":"File.Save","EventID":"5a41102f-961e-4097-841e-49285f4e55ea","SubjectID":"twprice@ncsu.edu","ToolInstances":"HINTSLabatNCState.provena-0.1.7","Order":118,"ClientTimestamp":"2026-03-19T20:59:54.160Z","SessionID":"563fd9c5-ab19-411a-9054-2999fb05a96f","CodeStateSection":"demo2.py","Code":"# How do you handle unautorized AI use in your classroom?\r\n# Provena tracks student work to identify\r\n# 1) Work they type\r\n# 2) Things the IDE inserts\r\n# 3) Externally pasted content\r\n# ---> go.ncsu.edu/provena <---\r\n\r\n# This is content I wrote\r\ndef my_function():\r\n    print(\"I wrote this by hand.\")\r\n\r\n# This is content I pated in:\r\nnum1 = 18\r\nnum2 = 7\r\nsum = num1 + num2\r\nprint(f\"Sum of {num1} and {num2} is {sum}\")\r\n\r\n# This is content that Copilot inserted:\r\ndef copilot_function():\r\n    print(\"I was inserted by Copilot!\")\r\n\r\n# This is me editing the file!!!\r\ndef my_function():\r\n    print(\"I wrote this by hand, and I edited it too!\")\r\n\r\n# That's a lie^^ I did not!"}
